PR #32  overall: compliant
Spec: Matrix multiply-accumulate instructions must trap on vstart ≠ 0 because their inner dot-product reduction across W packed sub-elements cannot be cleanly partitioned at SEW boundaries for interrupt/resume; hardware or emulators that ignore this silently corrupt accumulator state on trap return.
